sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户(前端)
    participant FE as AnalysisCenterView.vue
    participant API as VerdictRouter (POST /api/security-events/ai-verdict)
    participant Svc as EventVerdictService
    participant DB as security_events (SQLite)
    participant LLM as AgentLLM (大模型)
    participant Corr as IncidentCorrelator (下游消费者)

    U->>FE: 勾选事件 → 点击「🤖 AI 研判打标」
    FE->>API: POST {event_ids, force?, confidence_threshold?}
    API->>API: Depends(get_current_user) 鉴权；去重；>200 → 400
    API->>Svc: analyze_events(event_ids, user, force, threshold)

    loop 逐条 event_id
        Svc->>DB: SELECT id,evidence,ai_verdict WHERE id=?
        alt 事件不存在
            Svc-->>API: detail(status=failed, error=event_not_found)
        else 已研判且 force=False
            Svc-->>API: detail(status=skipped)
        else 需研判
            Svc->>Svc: data_masking.apply(evidence) 脱敏 → 构造 prompt
            Svc->>LLM: await call(prompt, user=user)
            alt degraded / 无内容 / 解析失败
                Svc->>Svc: 写 {label:"unknown", confidence:0, reason:"AI降级:...", attack_type:""}
                Svc-->>API: detail(status=degraded, label=unknown)
            else 正常
                Svc->>Svc: _parse_llm → _normalize(阈值降级 suspicious→benign)
                Svc->>DB: UPDATE ai_verdict=? (参数化)，可选 ai_analysis
                Svc-->>API: detail(status=processed, label)
            end
        end
    end

    Svc-->>API: {processed, skipped, degraded, failed, limit, details}
    API-->>FE: {code:0, data:..., message:"success"}
    FE-->>U: toast 汇总（研判/跳过/降级/失败）
    FE->>DB: 刷新列表与统计（含 ai_suspicious 计数）

    Note over Corr,DB: 后续（独立触发）：IncidentCorrelator 读取
    Corr->>DB: SELECT * WHERE json_extract(ai_verdict,'$.label')='suspicious'
    DB-->>Corr: 已研判的可疑事件（生产者产出）
